		},
		{
			"id": "784f2af6ef137cb9",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "D \u00b7 Note an idea or a bug for later",
			"x": -1250,
			"y": 1200,
			"width": 1040,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "99752bcdeea0d2eb",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "C \u00b7 Ingest sources",
			"x": -1250,
			"y": 790,
			"width": 2020,
			"height": 280,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "4bbcd88755649334",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "B \u00b7 Work on a repository: every change belongs to a thread",
			"x": -1250,
			"y": -800,
			"width": 4200,
			"height": 1240,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "3c18dc76ba182711",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "A \u00b7 A question or exploration",
			"x": -1250,
			"y": -1210,
			"width": 2460,
			"height": 330,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "62aa108b8819d012",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Start",
			"x": -2650,
			"y": -1150,
			"width": 1160,
			"height": 610
		},
		{
			"id": "5c20d1a72d97df2c",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Hooks: automatic, and keyed by the session id; they keep the session document true",
			"x": -2350,
			"y": -1770,
			"width": 6260,
			"height": 250,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "3b68025d00ffbc81",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# An Atlas agent session\nFrom the start of a session to its end: which skill each request goes to, which tools it calls, which hooks fire, and which documents it leaves. Colors follow the legend.",
			"x": -3000,
			"y": -2250,
			"width": 1000,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "89d878d804d65d83",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -3000,
			"y": -2020,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		},
		{
			"id": "15466e7d1ac43d05",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**SessionStart** hook\nfind the vault; create the session document; vault sync; print the context",
			"x": -2300,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 120,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "d0202fd3732af054",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**UserPromptSubmit** hook\nstatus running; names the note open in Obsidian",
			"x": -1800,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "50ff7964feb06d78",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**PreToolUse: guard**\nseven rules: read-only agents; apply before the user's turn; wiki/; code-owned files; other sessions' documents; thread frontmatter; a repository edit with no open thread that covers it",
			"x": -1400,
			"y": -1720,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "e6536440515c6ef5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**PostToolUse: touched**\nlinks the session to its threads, tasks, repositories, and changes",
			"x": -900,
			"y": -1710,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "0ba04d204aa64422",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Notification** hook\nstatus waiting: the session waits for you at a gate or a prompt",
			"x": -400,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "0a7b5f102d373419",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**SubagentStart / SubagentStop**\na child session document, or a line in the parent's for a read-only worker",
			"x": 100,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "d7968b088186fc18",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Stop** hook\nstatus idle; one reminder for what is left undone",
			"x": 3150,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "e8f427648f39f8a8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**SessionEnd** hook\nstatus ended",
			"x": 3600,
			"y": -1700,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a4bdfd6f6e9e0dac",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Session document**\n`sessions/2026-09/\u2026`\nstatus, description, thread, task, repositories, changes, progress, summary",
			"x": 700,
			"y": -1720,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 150,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "d1676b55cd3fffa4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Agent starts** in the vault, or in a linked repository",
			"x": -2600,
			"y": -1100,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "2abead683119474c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Opening context**\nthe vault \u00b7 where the session started \u00b7 open threads \u00b7 sessions running and waiting \u00b7 inbox \u00b7 pending documents \u00b7 proposed changes \u00b7 mentions",
			"x": -2600,
			"y": -940,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "e6edfee22b7fd507",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**User request**",
			"x": -2200,
			"y": -680,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "9542abffa545ddea",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**atlas** skill\nWhat does the user want?",
			"x": -1800,
			"y": -700,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "f176d2935f0e9d0f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-query**\nno thread",
			"x": -1200,
			"y": -1150,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "c2f6844f8407a3a7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**search**\nthe question's terms, its scope",
			"x": -860,
			"y": -1150,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "711f5460cf2bf5c7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Read the best pages; **context** for a question about scopes",
			"x": -520,
			"y": -1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "55c00bec85fdde15",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Answer, with citations; say what the wiki lacks",
			"x": -160,
			"y": -1150,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a13bf06ee060227f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Worth keeping?",
			"x": 200,
			"y": -1140,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "933c60fe9bb6854e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-save**\nwrite out the passage to keep",
			"x": 480,
			"y": -1160,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "16bfb69439089e68",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Turns into work?",
			"x": 200,
			"y": -1000,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "deb7172fc5b5445b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "\u2192 **source** capture the passage as pasted text; then the wiki pipeline",
			"x": 860,
			"y": -1160,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 90
		},
		{
			"id": "96dba88a85bcb836",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**search** types repository, area\nthen **context**: the chain, instructions, policies",
			"x": -1200,
			"y": -600,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "13c081c74d8be43c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Two repositories match?",
			"x": -800,
			"y": -590,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "7b38238ad4d093f4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The user** picks one",
			"x": -800,
			"y": -430,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "96fa912cea78e6c3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-work**",
			"x": -480,
			"y": -580,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "160a90eecabe67bc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**search** types stub, open stages, the request's words",
			"x": -160,
			"y": -600,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "e82854e872f84cc6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Does a thread for this work exist?",
			"x": 220,
			"y": -590,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "5dda314fba3751ce",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** attach\n(continue the thread)",
			"x": 560,
			"y": -710,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "1d3181dcd263a866",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-stub** \u2192 **thread** open, in the user's words",
			"x": 560,
			"y": -510,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "50feab4b60197d87",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Write `## Description` in the session document",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -590,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "1f1456ddfa648d19",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Thread View `next`?",
			"x": 1200,
			"y": -590,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "95eca8ac4f425f11",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-spec**\nresearch; ask only what reading cannot answer; the conventions step (**context** policies)",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "fb7c5c63f506a2f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** file spec",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": -80,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "9df836eb5f64ffdd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Gate 1**: the user agrees with the spec",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6a056d0bf8ebf04e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-plan**\nexplore the code; split into tasks; the conventions step per task",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "431cb9ff008ed9ec",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** tasks",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": -80,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "e1d72b00824b2f93",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Gate 2**: the user agrees with the tasks",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ed0e6d8a2b09fe58",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-run**\n**thread** task start \u2192 the hook binds the task",
			"x": 1800,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "48985db895ede742",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Edit files in the repository; test; commit in the repository's git",
			"x": 1800,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "1c08c43c8d96c553",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**guard** refuses the edit when no open thread covers the repository",
			"x": 1800,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "7187913388e8ebf3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Progress: a dated line in the task's `## Progress`",
			"x": 1800,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "497ac3bfabc30852",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** task done, with the result",
			"x": 1800,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "081bceee49d73335",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "A task still open?",
			"x": 2200,
			"y": 320,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "608cb0128e264526",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Ready, independent tasks may run in subagents; each gets a session document",
			"x": 2200,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "1123fe74c656e3f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-receipt**\n**thread-review** agent; fix or record what it finds",
			"x": 2600,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "bfd45634770257cb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** file receipt\ncompleted, or killed",
			"x": 2600,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "62d913ba38156175",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Write `## Summary` in the session document",
			"x": 2600,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "225300610d8c8027",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-sync** the spec and the receipt, as one change",
			"x": 2600,
			"y": 160,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "b647bc2da159f078",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**touched** hook: the session gets the thread",
			"x": 880,
			"y": -750,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "62554ad5f347980e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Notification** hook: status waiting while a gate waits for you",
			"x": 1000,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "9d026be7b2ae1803",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**SubagentStart** hook: a child session document, with the thread and task",
			"x": 2200,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "d2ce7e2f8a2315a8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-ingest**",
			"x": -1200,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "d295d711b7ad7c34",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**vault**: the inbox",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "2a824942341f78d6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Triage each item: wiki, thread, both; give each a scope",
			"x": -600,
			"y": 890,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "567c809f3b6d5fb7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The user** says yes to the triage table",
			"x": -240,
			"y": 890,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 90,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "53bd202da2dd03f8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**source** capture: one commit",
			"x": 100,
			"y": 840,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "336f55550b2197cf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** open with `inbox`",
			"x": 100,
			"y": 950,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "bdd0c315022de626",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-sync** the captured sources",
			"x": 460,
			"y": 840,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 70,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "37bf8b84f56ba490",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-stub**\nno questions",
			"x": -1200,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "24d5a6e462494a47",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**search** open stubs for the same work",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ba85ae601d4e6700",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread** open: a stub in the user's words; one line back",
			"x": -560,
			"y": 1250,
			"width": 300,
